3
00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:08.332
Estoy aquí para controlarte.

4
00:00:08.966 --> 00:00:09.765
ustedes chicos

5
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.132
esto es

6
00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:11.699
Oh

